{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN", "offset": 393, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf24781b82f2ff0e2f195f94bf1e2f1d5f0ef8143f0b5f0b5f144f8abf24781b8", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨∈//대답해 주세요，오오가미 씨∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さん∈//応答してください、大神さん！", "pointer_offset": 336, "unit": "dialogue:2cdce103928ca411", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN", "offset": 434, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "fb89f0d8f14381ac2f2ff16bfa89f1ccf0b2f0a8f8f4f154f1f3f15a8148", "baseline_text": "왜 그래〓//무슨 일이라도 있었어？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "どうしたんだ〓//なにかあったのか？", "pointer_offset": 340, "unit": "dialogue:6198bc182223c436", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN", "offset": 469, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f1f9f352f0a5f8a4f263f984f1daf95af1e2f1d5f0eff7d12f2ff0a4fa6af293f0e2f8e1f0c6f2aaf0c9f3a8f0b2f7d12f2ff0a6f0a8f291f0cef0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "당황하지 말고 들어 주세요…//지상 부대의 생명반응이…//사라졌습니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あわてずに聞いてください……//地上部隊の生命反応が……//消えたんです！", "pointer_offset": 344, "unit": "dialogue:0d4e18419a97843e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN", "offset": 540, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f25cf7d1f25cf0a8f18481ac2f2ff15af256f8f1f9fbf1c8f14881b82f2ff241f2aaf94bf26581b8", "baseline_text": "뭐…뭐라고〓//어떻게 된 거야∈//설명해 줘∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "な……なんだって〓//どういうことなんだ∈//説明してくれ！", "pointer_offset": 348, "unit": "dialogue:9108bde65753945b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN", "offset": 597, "capacity": 70, "raw_hex": "f0d8f28af7d1f0dff944f241f2aaf0a5f29ef0cef0b8f0cf81442f2ff1c5f17b8143f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f1d72f2ff0a4fa6af293f0e2f944f38cf0dbf9a9f3bcf0b9f7d1", "baseline_text": "그건…제가 설명하겠습니다．//방금，오오가미 씨와//지상 부대가 교신한 뒤에…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それは……私がします。//先ほど、大神さんと//地上部隊との交信のあと……", "pointer_offset": 352, "unit": "dialogue:c4abe1c787eff92b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN", "offset": 668, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0a4fa6af293f0e2f944f154f957f3e3f0b9f147f7d12f2ff0e2f2adf0c5f8b2f1ccf15af259f0cef0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "지상 부대가 있는 곳에서…//대폭발이 일어났습니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "地上部隊のいる場所で……//大爆発が起こったんです。", "pointer_offset": 356, "unit": "dialogue:3f7aed31804868c3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN", "offset": 719, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f0e2f2adf0c5f0b2f0a8f184f7d181482f2ff0cff9daf15af256f8f1f9fbf1c8f14881b8", "baseline_text": "대폭발이라고…？//다들 어떻게 된 거야∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大爆発だって……？//みんなはどうなったんだ∈", "pointer_offset": 360, "unit": "dialogue:e6e94e63721374a7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN", "offset": 764, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f1f7f974f26af540f944f991f1cff0aff147f7d12f2ff0aff16bf299f8f4f271f272f29ef15af7d1", "baseline_text": "전파 상태가 안 좋아서…//아무것도 모르겠어…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "電波状態が悪くて……//なにもわからないの……", "pointer_offset": 364, "unit": "dialogue:400060d885517c31", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN", "offset": 809, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f16bf0a6f1a9f0a4f7d12f2ff0aff3a0f0a4f14ef2bdf0f4f7d1", "baseline_text": "무사한지…//아닌지조차도…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "無事なのか……//どうなのかさえも……", "pointer_offset": 368, "unit": "dialogue:fec7a2fe4ddc6182", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN", "offset": 846, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0d8f143f147f7d1f0aff2612f2ff0d8fa62f1ccf0c8f7d1", "baseline_text": "그래서…아까//그런 일을…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それで……さっき//あんなことを……", "pointer_offset": 372, "unit": "dialogue:648bd9aa60730586", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN", "offset": 881, "capacity": 68, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f1d4f7d1f0b5f0b5f144f8abf24781442f2ff0acf0b2f2b8f8b9f0c9f3a8f8b2f1b5f8c8f2f3f0b2f0a481432f2ff199f8aff154f8c8f144f1e8f192f0f4f7d1", "baseline_text": "하지만…오오가미 씨．//레이더에 반응이 없을 뿐이지，//살아 있을 가능성도…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でも……大神さん。//レーダーに反応がないだけで、//生きている可能性だって……", "pointer_offset": 376, "unit": "dialogue:e1525965dc12a5a3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN", "offset": 958, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0aff0af8143f0d8f14381442f2ff199f0aff947f0d0f0aff0b5f29ef0cff18481432f2ff2d8f15cf0ccf0a2f0b8f261f7d1", "baseline_text": "아아，그래．//살아서 돌아오겠다고，//약속했으니까…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ああ、そうだな。//生きて帰って来るって、//約束したんだ……", "pointer_offset": 380, "unit": "dialogue:bf676c832c5e4f5c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN", "offset": 1017, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0c7f0b8f261f7d12f2ff1cefaaaf199f8aff154f8c8f1c8f1488144", "baseline_text": "그러니까…//분명 살아 있을 거야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "だから……//きっと生きているはずだ。", "pointer_offset": 384, "unit": "dialogue:f0de7db17feefa52", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04038.SBN", "offset": 1054, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 388, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
